# Python environment
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Raw downloads — reproducible with scripts/, 41 MB, not worth versioning
# (jordan-latest.osm.pbf is 30 MB, the WorldCover tile 8 MB)
data/raw/*
!data/raw/aoi/
!data/raw/aoi/**

# Intermediates and the local catchment test fixture. The fixture MUST NOT be
# shared — contract §4 P1 gives catchment ownership to Mahdi, and a second
# AQ-C{NN} geometry in circulation is exactly what the ID contract prevents.
data/interim/
data/outputs/

# data/aoi/ and data/processed/ ARE committed on purpose: they are the shared
# contract paths from 00-contracts.md §3 that other people's code reads
# (reef zones, coastline, depth field, feature tables). ~8 MB total.
